```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph MD_Interaction [Managing Director Workflow]
        A[Enter DPIK Tadbir] --> B{Select Workflow}
        B -->|Prompt AI| C[Open AI Chat Assistant]
        B -->|Browse Inbox| D[Open Visual Inbox / Threads]
        B -->|Review Projects| E[Open Projects / Staff Board]
        B -->|Check Workspace| F[Open Personal Notes / Tasks]
    end

    subgraph AI_Processing [AI & Tool Execution Engine]
        C --> G[AgentService Loop]
        G --> H{Determine Needed Tools}
        H -->|Outlook / Gmail| I[outlook-mcp / Graph API]
        H -->|Personal Notes| J[PersonalNote Model]
        H -->|Projects / Staff| K[Project & Ticket Models]
        
        I --> L[Fetch Email Context / Delta]
        K --> M[Fetch Project Status & Workload]
        
        L --> N[Synthesize Evidence-Based Answer]
        M --> N
        
        N --> O{Requires Mutation / Action?}
        O -->|No| P[Stream Response to User]
        O -->|Yes| Q[Render Structured Action Proposal]
    end

    subgraph Approval_Gate [Human-in-the-Loop Write Safety]
        Q --> R[Review Diff / Draft]
        R --> S{MD Decision}
        S -->|Discard / Edit| T[Cancel / Refine Prompt]
        S -->|Approve & Execute| U[Execute Action]
        U -->|Send Email| V[Dispatch via outlook_send_message]
        U -->|Save Note| W[Commit to personal_notes table]
        U -->|Reassign Ticket| X[Update tickets table]
        
        V --> Y[Log to Activity Audit & Show Toast]
        W --> Y
        X --> Y
    end
```
